/-!
# TinyTauDemo

`Algebra` contains polynomial tools, including Mason–Stothers.
`AlgebraicGeometry` contains the general results on schemes, divisors, and Riemann–Hurwitz.
`Fermat` contains the integer and polynomial theorems, the projective curve, and its arithmetic
surface. `NumberTheory` contains the Bernoulli, cyclotomic, and class field theory developments.
-/
